nd  that's how they got the magnitude  information but you can imagine doing  that for you know the dozens of these  big glass plates and it with a  microscope and it's it really makes you  respect the efforts of these people who  did this right right so they would have  to extract this data and then from  hundreds of observations you can get  information about the period of the  variable star  any other questions okay well I think  really  [Applause]
 

